  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia Regional Nutrition and Food Security Initiative project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity South Asia Regional Nutrition and Food Security Initiative project is a component of South Asia Regional Food &amp; Nutrition Security Multi Donor Trust Fund reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,032,320. This project benefits Asia, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Food assistance, Basic nutrition, Social Protection, Environmental policy and administrative management, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
